Can you even hear me? Jojo!

261
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,140
Please, say something!

262
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:18,720
What a moron.

263
00:18:18,900 --> 00:18:23,488
You think that parachute is your salvation,
but all it does is seal your fate.

264
00:18:23,740 --> 00:18:26,622
You're just a butterfly
caught in a spider's web.

265
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:32,020
Now, Jojo, time to split you asunder!

266
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:34,350
What the?

267
00:18:34,660 --> 00:18:37,100
But if this is a decoy... Hmm?

268
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:38,710
Hmph!

269
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:40,830
Ah!

270
00:18:40,913 --> 00:18:41,743
Hey, cars!

271
00:18:42,420 --> 00:18:43,580
I'm a Joestar!

272
00:18:43,940 --> 00:18:45,881
We don't go down without a fight!

273
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:48,297
You and I have got a
date with that volcano!

274
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:49,820
Don't try to weasel out!

275
00:18:50,540 --> 00:18:51,370
Joosho!

276
00:18:53,260 --> 00:18:54,090
Ahhhh!

277
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:55,390
Danny!

278
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:03,200
You're a lunatic!

279
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:14,780
Granny Iran, a long time ago,
you told me about my grandfather.

280
00:19:15,640 --> 00:19:21,080
You said he died on the Atlantic to save
you and father from his greatest foe.

281
00:19:23,340 --> 00:19:26,400
Trust me, I don't mean to be a copycat.

282
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:33,580
Maybe this is the hand my blood dealt me.

283
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:38,940
Really, now?

284
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:41,377
Do you think I can pry
myself from this foul

285
00:19:41,460 --> 00:19:44,497
contraption before you try
to smash it into the ground,

286
00:19:44,580 --> 00:19:46,020
you gibbering primate?

287
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:47,920
You coward!

288
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:52,360
Know that your death
won't accomplish anything!

289
00:20:00,620 --> 00:20:01,450
Is...

290
00:20:01,533 --> 00:20:02,600
is that a hand?

291
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:10,757
What a shame all of your
scheming and still you die here?

292
00:20:10,840 --> 00:20:13,197
Damn you, Von Stroheim!

293
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:14,140
Oh.

294
00:20:15,320 --> 00:20:17,097
How did you get into the plane?

295
00:20:17,180 --> 00:20:19,017
When did you have time?

296
00:20:19,100 --> 00:20:23,957
I wasn't sure you could
handle this battle. All alone.

297
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:26,677
Next time I should stow away in the cabin.

298
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:29,537
Proper next time, huh?

299
00:20:29,620 --> 00:20:31,057
Then I give the word.

300
00:20:31,140 --> 00:20:32,420
Jump out, Jojo!

301
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:34,760
Not on your life! No way!

302
00:20:35,100 --> 00:20:38,200
Believe it or not, piranhas
ate my damn parachute!

303
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:41,940
Unless you want to die, jump
out of there this instant!

304
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:51,240
Please respond!

305
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:53,069
I don't care what you say!

306
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:56,000
Tell a bad joke, or call me an old man!

307
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:59,060
Let me hear your voice
one more time! I'm...

308
00:21:02,900 --> 00:21:03,730
Jojo...

309
00:21:21,340 --> 00:21:23,420
Stroheim, you're crazy!

310
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:25,677
I'm crazy too, but...

311
00:21:25,760 --> 00:21:27,977
I admit when someone's got me beat...

312
00:21:28,060 --> 00:21:30,940
That was a pretty courageous move.

313
00:21:31,520 --> 00:21:33,340
You seem to be all right.

314
00:21:33,520 --> 00:21:35,680
But what about Vertigo?

315
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:38,374
Please tell me cars fell into the lava.

316
00:21:46,140 --> 00:21:49,420
I'm still alive.

317
00:22:05,860 --> 00:22:11,017
I'll be the roundabout The words will make

318
00:22:11,100 --> 00:22:16,440
you out and out You'll
spend the day your way

319
00:22:18,420 --> 00:22:22,560
Calling morning, running through
the sun And in and out the valley

320
00:22:24,520 --> 00:22:27,000
In and around the lake

321
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:32,280
Minds come out of the sky They stand there

322
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:38,980
One mile over We'll be there We'll see you

323
00:22:41,300 --> 00:22:45,160
Two samples We'll be there You'll be too

324
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:53,440
Twenty-four We'll see you
I'll be there with you

325
00:23:29,060 --> 00:23:31,637
Did you say harm on overdrive?

326
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:33,132
Who's laughing now, huh?

327
00:23:33,260 --> 00:23:36,200
To purge your fears and
reign forever as God!

328
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:37,790
JoJo!

329
00:23:39,860 --> 00:23:41,500
Everyone, goodbye.
